  "current_evidence_state": "Both matched local-refinement runs have returned and been independently audited. They lower corner-pair accuracy relative to their shared research control without changing detections. Both the supplied original model and the proposed method were reexecuted on all 20 photographs in a common CPU runtime, reproducing the reported reviewed-reference improvement and adverse earlier-reference sensitivity. The manuscript uses the supplied original model as its benchmark and retains these limits.",
